# fixture use.stable.force: forces a flag no other fixture package's
# IUSE declares, so this has zero effect on any other test -- exercises
# the global (non-package) half of use.stable.mask/.force, applied only
# to a candidate real KeywordsManager.isStable would consider stable
# (see dev-libs/stableusepkg vs dev-libs/unstableusepkg, and
# portage-repo's own is_stable doc comment).
stableforceflag
